// THE FOUR DOORS INTO JALSAVRAH. The cache ships them with no option at all, because in Old School
// the server puts one on them; here the Open is written in. One of the four is the way in and the
// other three are not - which one changes every twenty-five minutes, read straight off the world
// clock so that every player agrees without anything being stored (scripts/plunder.rs2).
